        "answer": "Shortlisted candidates must upload scanned copies of original documents to the DSSSB e-Dossier module: 10th Certificate & Marksheet (for DOB proof), Essential Qualification Degrees & Marksheets, B.Ed / D.El.Ed certificates, CTET Marksheet/Certificate, Category Certificate (SC/ST/OBC-Delhi/EWS), 480×672 px Postcard Photo, Signature scan, and Admit Card."
